      "family": "prohibitions -- 'do not move a piece to a square a cheaper piece attacks'",
      "why": "Hits are non-events: complying with a prohibition looks identical to never having considered it. The noise trial would be every other move in the position, so the false-alarm cell has no natural denominator."
